     "video": "/fileadmin/01_Pages/Startingpage/zollerinfo_header_animation_780.mp4",
     "title": "One System for Maximized Value",
     "kicker": "",
     "text": "<p>Increase the efficiency of your manufacturing process<br/>with solutions from ZOLLER, a technology leader.</p>",
     "buttons": [],
     "light": false
    }
   ],
   "ftype": "zoller_hero-slider",
   "id": "c2274",
   "bg": "lightgray",
   "space": {}
  },
  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h2> Premium technology for every process </h2>",
   "body": "<p class=\"extra-large-text\"><br/>ZOLLER Solutions ensure you can produce more parts with higher quality and a lower cost.</p> <p class=\"extra-large-text\">At ZOLLER, premium is a promise, not a privilege.</p>",
   "images": [
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/5/2/csm_az_cz_30f31cdd7e.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 1155,
     "h": 1034
    }
   ],
   "videos": [],
   "pos": "right",
   "cols": 1,
   "valign": "center",
   "ftype": "textmedia",
   "id": "c539",
   "bg": "yellow",
   "space": {
    "before": "default",
    "after": "default"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "kpis",
   "title": "Customer success with ZOLLER",
   "subtitle": "Higher profits, more orders, less time, and lower production costs - ZOLLER increases the efficiency of its customers worldwide.",
   "items": [
    {
     "label": "Set up at high speed",
     "value": "30 %",
     "text": "<p>This is how much a ZOLLER »hyperion« reduces set-up times at SycoTec. Turning tools and multiple turning holders are measured on the horizontal setting and tool measuring machine to produce high-speed micromotors.</p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/in/your-success/detail?tx_news_pi1%5Bnews%5D=116&amp;cHash=421d313fd09bbdfb23f6ea4d752d4ee7\">The success story</a></p>"
    },
    {
     "label": "Reduce personnel expenses",
     "value": "83 %",
     "text": "<p>This is the potential reduction in personnel costs when inspecting tools in a three-shift operation with the »roboSet 2« tool inspection automation solution.</p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/in/products/automation/tool-inspection/roboset-2\">More about »roboSet 2«</a></p>"
    },
    {
     "label": "Rapid amortization",
     "value": "9 months",
     "text": "<p>This is the average time it takes for a »smile« tool presetting and measuring machine to pay for itself when changing production in single-shift operation with one CNC machine to two.</p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/in/products/presetting-measuring/vertical-devices/smile\">More about »smile«</a></p>"
    },
    {
     "label": "High increase in sales",
     "value": "$1 million",
     "text": "<p>This is how much ProCam, a small family-owned business from Michigan, has increased its turnover within two years of purchasing a »smile 420«. Thanks to shorter set-up times and less machine tool downtime, ProCam was able to produce more parts.</p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/in/your-success/detail?tx_news_pi1%5Bnews%5D=37&amp;cHash=992d0db4f33082f4543da88c75286a33\">The success story</a></p>"
    }
   ],
   "ftype": "zoller_content-scroller",
   "id": "c537",
   "bg": "",
   "space": {
    "before": "default",
    "after": "default"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "cta_strip",
   "icon": {
    "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/0/0/csm_calculator_8806cc3f97.webp",
    "alt": "",
    "w": 50,
    "h": 65
   },
   "text": "<p class=\"bold\">Increased productivity with ZOLLER presetting and measuring machines</p> <p>The ZOLLER profitability calculator calculates the savings potential of your business.</p>",
   "button": "<a class=\"btn\" href=\"/in/profitability-calculator\">Determine savings potential now</a>",
   "ftype": "zoller_icon-button",
