   "header": "<h3> \"Automation is essential in order to be internationally competitive.\" </h3>",
   "body": "<p class=\"large-text\">Michael Mauth, Managing Director of Mauth Werkzeug- Schleiftechnik in Oberndorf</p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/in/your-success/detail?tx_news_pi1%5Bnews%5D=109&amp;cHash=edd71d398b779dcca094c57186138635\">To the case study</a></p>",
