   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h2> \"Digitalization with software systems from ZOLLER made a decisive contribution to significantly more economical production.\" </h2>",
   "body": "<p class=\"large-text\">Dipl.-Ing. Frank Schaefer, Member of the Management Board, LIDU Maschinenbau Lienenbrügger GmbH in Dülmen</p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/in/your-success/detail?tx_news_pi1%5Bnews%5D=112&amp;cHash=5bd9e00bf990db26ead5dc36b56cb9be\">To the case study</a></p>",
