  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h2> <a href=\"/in/homepage\">Maximize value with tool shrinking</a> </h2>",
   "body": "<p class=\"large-text\">»powerShrink« shrinks tools with record-breaking speed and energy efficiency. With »powerShrink«, shrink fit tool holders can be safely and sustainably heated and cooled.</p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/in/products/shrink-technology/powershrink\">More about »powerShrink«</a></p>",
